.Dd November 3, 2026
.Dt MK.SKIPPED.MK 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mk.skipped.mk
.Nd what an excluded module or framework does
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Replaces a role file's normal body when
.Va PLATFORMS
or
.Va TOOLCHAINS
exclude it here.
Nothing is built, copied up, tested or imported.
.Cm all
prints one line saying so and exits 0, and
.Cm clean
still removes the output.
.Pp
Not included directly by a makefile.
.Sh FILES
Markers that let a dependent tell excluded from failed:
.Bl -tag -width "build/KEY/runs/RUN_ID/build.excluded"
.It Pa build/ Ns Ar KEY Ns Pa /.skipped/ Ns Va LIB
a library module; read when something links it
.It Pa build/ Ns Ar KEY Ns Pa /runs/ Ns Va RUN_ID Ns Pa /build.excluded
a framework; read by the workspace
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr bmake-it 7 ,
.Xr mk.constraints.mk 5
